"nk6_bxx_ot8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m030-0425","start":425,"end":428,"surface":"韓延壽","kind":"person","person_id":"iff_ztt_r2h","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m030-0429","start":429,"end":432,"surface":"尹翁歸","kind":"person","person_id":"ji8_fud_li3","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m030-0433","start":433,"end":436,"surface":"趙廣漢","kind":"person","person_id":"5dy_3tn_y1j","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin","book_id":"b-shiji-112","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji112-pingjin"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:p015","text":"武帝時，齊人有東方生名朔，以好古傳書，愛經術，多所博觀外家之語。朔初入長安，至公車上書，凡用三千奏牘。公車令兩人共持舉其書，僅然能勝之。人主從上方讀之，止，輒乙其處，讀之二月乃盡。詔拜以為郎，常在側侍中。數召至前談語，人主未嘗不說也。時詔賜之食於前。飯已，盡懷其餘肉持去，衣盡汙。數賜縑帛，檐揭而去。徒用所賜錢帛，取少婦於長安中好女。率取婦一歲所者即棄去，更取婦。所賜錢財盡索之於女子。人主左右諸郎半呼之「狂人」。人主聞之，曰：「令朔在事無為是行者，若等安能及之哉！」朔任其子為郎，又為侍謁者，常持節出使。朔行殿中，郎謂之曰：「人皆以先生為狂。」朔曰：「如朔等，所謂避世於朝廷閒者也。古之人，乃避世於深山中。」時坐席中，酒酣，據地歌曰：「陸沈於俗，避世金馬門。宮殿中可以避世全身，何必深山之中，蒿廬之下。」金馬門者，宦者署門也，門傍有銅馬，故謂之曰「金馬門」。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"witness_appended_chu_note","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m015-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"武帝","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m015-0007","start":7,"end":12,"surface":"東方生名朔","kind":"person","person_id":"s11_z5r_y2z","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m015-0032","start":32,"end":33,"surface":"朔","kind":"person","person_id":"s11_z5r_y2z","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m015-0051","start":51,"end":56,"surface":"公車令兩人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m015-0068","start":68,"end":70,"surface":"人主","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m015-0094","start":94,"end":95,"surface":"郎","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id"