},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m015-0278","start":278,"end":279,"surface":"朔","kind":"person","person_id":"s11_z5r_y2z","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-126-huaji","book_id":"b-shiji-126","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji126-huaji"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:p016","text":"時會聚宮下博士諸先生與論議，共難之曰：「蘇秦、張儀一當萬乘之主，而都卿相之位，澤及後世。今子大夫修先王之術，慕聖人之義，諷誦詩書百家之言，不可勝數。著於竹帛，自以為海內無雙，即可謂博聞辯智矣。然悉力盡忠以事聖帝，曠日持久，積數十年，官不過侍郎，位不過執戟，意者尚有遺行邪？其故何也？」東方生曰：「是固非子所能備也。彼一時也，此一時也，豈可同哉！夫張儀、蘇秦之時，周室大壞，諸侯不朝，力政爭權，相禽以兵，并為十二國，未有雌雄，得士者彊，失士者亡，故說聽行通，身處尊位，澤及後世，子孫長榮。今非然也。聖帝在上，德流天下，諸侯賓服，威振四夷，連四海之外以為帶，安於覆盂，天下平均，合為一家，動發舉事，猶如運之掌中。賢與不肖，何以異哉？方今以天下之大，士民之眾，竭精馳說，并進輻湊者，不可勝數。悉力慕義，困於衣食，或失門戶。使張儀、蘇秦與仆并生於今之世，曾不能得掌故，安敢望常侍侍郎乎！傳曰：『天下無害菑，雖有聖人，無所施其才；上下和同，雖有賢者，無所立功。』故曰時異則事異；雖然，安可以不務修身乎？《詩》曰：『鼓鐘于宮，聲聞于外。鶴鳴九皋，聲聞于天。』苟能修身，何患不榮！太公躬行仁義七十二年，逢文王，得行其說，封於齊，七百歲而不絕。此士之所以日夜孜孜，修學行道，不敢止也。今世之處士，時雖不用，崛然獨立，塊然獨處，上觀許由，下察接輿，策同范蠡，忠合子胥，天下和平，與義相扶，寡偶少徒，固其常也。子何疑於余哉！」於是諸先生默然無以應也。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"witness_appended_chu_note","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m016-0007","start":7,"end":10,"surface":"諸先生","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m016-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"蘇秦","kind":"person","person_id":"5pz_90e_hzm","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m016-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"張儀","kind":"person","person_id":"vsm_g44_lxu","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m016-0103","start":103,"end":105,"surface":"聖帝","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m016-0142","start":142,"end":145,"surface":"東方生","kind":"person","person_id":"s11_z5r_y2z","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m016-0173","start":173,"end":175,"surface":"張儀","kind":"person","person_id":"vsm_g44_lxu","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m016-0176","start":176,"end":178,"surface":"蘇秦","kind":"person","person_id":"5pz_90e_hzm","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m016-0248","start":248,"end":250,"surface":"聖帝","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m016-0359","start":359,"end":361,"surface":"張儀","kind":"person","person_id":"vsm_g44_lxu","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m016-0362","start":362,"end":364,"surface":"蘇秦","kind":"person","person_id":"5pz_90e_hzm","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m016-0483","start":483,"end":485,"surface":"太公","kind":"person","person_id":"39x_aqh_sst","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m016-0495","start":495,"end":497,"surface":"文王","kind":"person","person_id":"vlq_85b_6qa","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m016-0557","start":557,"end":559,"surface":"許由","kind":"person","person_id":"fyj_7r5_9ws","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m016-0562","start":562,"end":564,"surface":"接輿","kind":"person","person_id":"n1d_kk9_jkd","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m016-0567","start":567,"end":569,"surface":"范蠡","kind":"person","person_id":"yhm_h9f_8p0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m016-0572","start":572,"end":574,"surface":"子胥","kind":"person","person_id":"qme_5ae_ovf","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m016-0605","start":605,"end":608,"surface":"諸先生","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-126-huaji","book_id":"b-shiji-126","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji126-huaji"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:p017","text":"建章宮後閤重櫟中有物出焉，其狀似麋。以聞，武帝往臨視之。問左右群臣習事通經術者，莫能知。詔東方朔視之。朔曰：「臣知之，願賜美酒粱飯大飱臣，臣乃言。」詔曰：「可。」已又曰：「某所有公田魚池蒲葦數頃，陛下以賜臣，臣朔乃言。」詔曰：「可。」於是朔乃肯言，曰：「所謂騶牙者也。遠方當來歸義，而騶牙先見。其齒前后若一，齊等無牙，故謂之騶牙。」其後一歲所，匈奴混邪王果將十萬眾來降漢。乃復賜東方生錢財甚多。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"witness_appended_chu_note","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m017-0021","start":21,"end":23,"surface":"武帝","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m017-0045","start":45,"end":48,"surface":"東方朔","kind":"person","person_id":"s11_z5r_y2z","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m017-0051","start":51,"end":52,"surface":"朔","kind":"person","person_id":"s11_z5r_y2z","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m017-0098","start":98,"end":100,"surface":"陛下","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m017-0105","start":105,"end":106,"surface":"朔","kind":"person","person_id":"s11_z5r_y2z","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m017-0119","start":119,"end":120,"surface":"朔","kind":"person","person_id":"s11_z5r_y2z","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m017-0174","start":174,"end":177,"surface":"混邪王","kind":"person","person_id":"rht_70o_mfq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m017-0189","start":189,"end":192,"surface":"東方生","kind":"person","person_id":"s11_z5r_y2z","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-126-huaji","book_id":"b-shiji-126","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji126-huaji"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:p018","text":"至老，朔且死時，諫曰：「《詩》云：『營營青蠅，止于蕃。愷悌君子，無信讒言。讒言罔極，交亂四國。』願陛下遠巧佞，退讒言。」帝曰：「今顧東方朔多善言？」怪之。居無幾何，朔果病死。傳曰：「鳥之將死，其鳴也哀；人之將死，其言也善。」此之謂也。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"witness_appended_chu_note","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m018-0003","start":3,"end":4,"surface":"朔","kind":"person","person_id":"s11_z5r_y2z","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m018-0049","start":49,"end":51,"surface":"陛下","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m018-0060","start":60,"end":61,"surface":"帝","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m018-0066","start":66,"end":69,"surface":"東方朔","kind":"person","person_id":"s11_z5r_y2z","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m018-0082","start":82,"end":83,"surface":"朔","kind":"person","person_id":"s11_z5r_y2z","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-126-huaji","book_id":"b-shiji-126","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji126-huaji"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:p027","text":"滑稽鴟夷，如脂如韋。敏捷之變，學不失詞。淳于索絕，趙國興師。楚優拒相，寢丘獲祠。偉哉方朔，三章紀之。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"witness_appended_suoyin_zan","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m027-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"淳于","kind":"person","person_id":"0jo_ejm_n20","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m027-0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"楚優","kind":"person","person_id":"3sn_ajy_26l","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m027-0042","start":42,"end":44,"surface":"方朔","kind":"person","person_id":"s11_z5r_y2z","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-126-huaji","book_id":"b-shiji-126","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji126-huaji"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-112","source_id":"s-shiji112-pingjin","source":{"title":"史記／卷112","provider":"維基文庫","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/史記/卷112","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷112&oldid=2089420","revision_id":2089420,"accessed_on":"2026-10-11","extent":"固定數位見證31段；末三段分為後附詔書、班固贊及索隱述贊。","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代原文；數位轉錄依維基文庫CC BY-SA 4.0，保留署名及固定版本。","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","normalization":{"character_conversion":{},"editorial_readings":[],"extraction_note":"去header2、__TOC__與現代節標題；去行首冒號排版符號，保留正文、異體、方括弧與圓括弧校字。未核底本影像。","note":"太皇太后詔及班固贊均按見證附載分層，不自行確認編入者。"}}},{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-126-huaji","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-126","source_id":"s-shiji126-huaji","source":{"title":"史記／卷126","provider":"維基文庫","url":"https://zh.wikisour